<!-- HEADER -->
<div class="header">
  <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;">
    <div class="header-badge">Market Intelligence Report</div>
    <h1>Air Jordan Sneaker Resale Market Analysis<br>2023 – 2026</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A comprehensive analysis of 5,000 Air Jordan secondary-market transactions examining pricing dynamics, profit margins, inventory velocity, and channel performance across models, colorways, and conditions.</p>
    <div class="meta">
      <span><b>Dataset:</b> 5,000 transactions</span>
      <span><b>Period:</b> Jan 2023 – Sep 2025</span>
      <span><b>Models:</b> 5 silhouettes</span>
      <span><b>Channels:</b> 5 platforms</span>
      <span><b>Generated:</b> April 21, 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">

  <!-- TOC -->
  <nav class="toc">
    <span class="toc-label">Sections</span>
    <a href="#overview">1. Market Overview</a>
    <a href="#model-colorway">2. Model &amp; Colorway</a>
    <a href="#condition">3. Condition Impact</a>
    <a href="#channel">4. Channel Performance</a>
    <a href="#trends">5. Temporal Trends</a>
    <a href="#recommendations">6. Recommendations</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- KPI DASHBOARD -->
  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card gold">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Profit Margin</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">$82.06</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Mean across all 5,000 transactions</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card blue">
      <div class="kpi-label">Resale Premium Rate</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">61.3%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Transactions clearing above retail</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card green">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Days in Inventory</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">22.5</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Mean hold time before sale</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card red">
      <div class="kpi-label">Resale-to-Retail Ratio</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">1.43×</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Avg resale price vs. MSRP</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card purple">
      <div class="kpi-label">Top Colorway Margin</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">$89.23</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Pine Green — highest avg margin</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ====================================================
       SECTION 1: MARKET OVERVIEW
       ==================================================== -->
  <div class="section" id="overview">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">01</span>
      <h2>Market Overview &amp; Transaction Summary</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-obj">High-level summary of total transactions, date range coverage, average retail vs. resale prices, and the overall profit margin distribution across the 5,000-transaction dataset.</p>

    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Profit Margin Distribution</h3>
        <p class="card-sub">Monthly avg profit margin (USD) — Jan 2023 to Sep 2025</p>
        <div class="chart-wrap">
          <canvas id="chartMarginTimeline"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Retail vs. Resale Price — by Model</h3>
        <p class="card-sub">Average MSRP vs. secondary-market clearing price per silhouette</p>
        <div class="chart-wrap">
          <canvas id="chartRetailVsResale"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Dataset At-a-Glance</h3>
      <p class="card-sub">Core descriptive statistics derived from all 5,000 transactions</p>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Metric</th>
              <th>Value</th>
              <th>Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td class="bold">Total Transactions</td><td class="num bold">5,000</td><td>Synthetic, no missing values</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Date Range</td><td class="num">Jan 1, 2023 – Sep 27, 2025</td><td>33 months of data</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Avg Retail Price (MSRP)</td><td class="num">$191.17</td><td>Range: ~$130–$250</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Avg Resale Price</td><td class="num">$273.23</td><td>+$82.06 over MSRP</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Avg Profit Margin</td><td class="num pos">+$82.06</td><td>Mean; median is $35.27 (right-skewed)</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Profit Margin Range</td><td class="num">–$114.35 to +$574.58</td><td>Wide spread; condition-driven</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Margin Std Deviation</td><td class="num">$159.07</td><td>High variance; model/condition driven</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Resale Premium Rate</td><td class="num">61.3%</td><td>3-in-5 transactions profitable</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Avg Days in Inventory</td><td class="num">22.5 days</td><td>Varies sharply by channel</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="bold">Avg Resale-to-Retail Ratio</td><td class="num">1.4272×</td><td>Overall market premium</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="insight-grid">
      <div class="insight-box gold">
        <h4>Right-Skewed Margin Distribution</h4>
        <p>The mean profit margin ($82.06) is significantly higher than the median ($35.27), indicating a long right tail driven by Deadstock transactions at premium prices. Analysts should not treat the mean as "typical" — median better reflects the most likely outcome.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-box blue">
        <h4>Minority Achieve True Premium</h4>
        <p>Only 61.3% of transactions clear above retail. Nearly 4-in-10 transactions result in a loss vs. MSRP, concentrated almost entirely in Used-condition inventory — a critical sourcing risk to quantify.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-box green">
        <h4>Fast-Moving Market</h4>
        <p>At 22.5 days average, inventory cycles are relatively rapid. However, channel selection has a 4× impact on hold time — GOAT and StockX average ~7.5 days vs. 33+ days on local channels.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ====================================================
       SECTION 2: MODEL & COLORWAY
       ==================================================== -->
  <div class="section" id="model-colorway">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">02</span>
